abstract: >-
  MAREF is an Agent Governance Operating System implementing a six-layer
  recursive governance architecture with an Eight-Trigrams trust state machine
  based on Gray Code transitions. It provides G1-G5 governance auditors,
  MCP bridging, TLA+ formal specifications, and a desktop GUI.
